sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as scheduler/bunzy_import
    participant Bunzy as app.bunzy.io/api/v1
    participant Imp as blog.bunzy_import
    participant MD as blog.markdown_html
    participant DB as Postgres
    actor Editor
    participant SPA as apps/admin

    Note over Job: hourly — not registered at all without BUNZY_API_KEY

    Job->>Bunzy: GET /posts?limit=20 (Bearer key)
    Bunzy-->>Job: [{slug, updatedAt}, …]
    Job->>Imp: stale_slugs(summaries)
    Imp->>DB: SELECT blog_imported_posts WHERE external_id IN (…)
    Imp-->>Job: only the slugs whose revision moved

    loop each stale slug (own session, own transaction)
        Job->>Bunzy: GET /posts/{slug}
        Bunzy-->>Job: markdown + keyTakeaways + faq + seo
        Job->>Imp: sync_post(post)
        Imp->>MD: markdown_to_html(takeaways + body)
        MD-->>Imp: allowlisted HTML (h1→h2, images dropped, no attrs)

        alt first time we see this slug
            Imp->>DB: INSERT blog_posts (status='draft', primary_brand_id=NULL)
            Imp->>DB: INSERT translation + blog_post_faqs + blog_imported_posts
        else source unchanged
            Imp->>DB: UPDATE last_seen_at
        else our copy no longer hashes to what we wrote
            Note over Imp: a person edited it — stop, permanently
        else post left 'draft'
            Note over Imp: published / scheduled / archived — never touched
        else still ours and still a draft
            Imp->>DB: UPDATE translation + replace FAQ + new fingerprints
        end
    end

    Editor->>SPA: open the draft, attach a brand, fix, publish
    SPA->>DB: publish refuses while primary_brand_id IS NULL
